      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "花蓓蓓真是太可愛了……！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我去把各種顏色的花蓓蓓\n都給捉起來好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
